sequenceDiagram
    actor Owner as DSH 所有者
    participant Host as Mac 与已选 DSH
    participant Device as Sion DSH.AGENT
    Owner->>Host: 开启 USB 待命
    Host->>Host: 核对配对设备并打开串口
    Host->>Device: SIONU0 探测
    Note over Host,Device: 未点 USB 时保持等待，麦克风关闭
    Owner->>Device: 在 Sion 点 USB
    Host->>Device: 下一次探测
    Device-->>Host: 回复本次就绪
    Host->>Device: SIONU1 后开始配对 TLS
    Device-->>Host: 空闲 hello
    Host->>Device: 已有会话和本地语音就绪后发送 Start
    alt 说「停止」且设备确认资源已释放
        Host->>Device: 关闭 TLS
        Host->>Host: 回收旧串口，继续等待设备触屏
    else 拔线或 Mac 撤销待命
        Host->>Host: 退出待命并释放串口
    end
